sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor C as Customer
participant B as Payment Bank
participant R as RAAST API Gateway
participant O as Open Connect (RSOP)
participant G as Government Biller (Mock)
C->>B: Select institution and enter bill reference
B->>R: Bill Inquiry API (institution, bill reference)
R->>O: Forward Bill Inquiry request
O->>G: Call mock Bill Inquiry web service
G->>G: Retrieve bill and generate unique inquiry identifier
G-->>O: Bill details, amount, currency, unique inquiry identifier
O->>O: Persist identifier and amount pair<br/>with institution, bill reference and status OPEN
O-->>R: Bill details, amount, currency, unique inquiry identifier
R-->>B: Return Bill Inquiry response
B->>B: Retain inquiry identifier for PACS.008 payment
B-->>C: Display bill details and payable amount
